#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5469 end.04
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:9388c4b7f15e7321"
msgstr "\"No, no! I may look like this now,~but I'm human! Please, listen to me.\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x54FB end.05
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:86660a959ef45217"
msgstr "         \"All right, talk.\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x555A end.06
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:3e5443fc58261b4a"
msgstr "\"Truth is, though I look like this,~I was once the director of BIAS. But~the government scum tricked me into~making that devil's drug, and in the~end its tests turned me into this.\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5638 end.07
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:383466f4667a2dbf"
msgstr "       \"What drug is that?\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5696 end.08
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:44f315b3699ca2d1"
msgstr "\"A drug that turns people into living~weapons... In their hands it would be~a disaster. So I took control of BIAS~to keep the drug away from them.~But this is as far as I go... Ugh!\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5758 end.09
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:d52de6c609dca8a4"
msgstr "\"Please... take this drug somewhere~they can't reach it...\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x57C5 end.10
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:be19aca68ff3d8ce"
msgstr "   \"All right, I'll take it. Who knew~  the last treasure was this nasty?\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5846 end.11
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:89ba7920725bb383"
msgstr "\"I-I'm counting on you!\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x589A end.12
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:62b92d390d2ad692"
msgstr "You took the drug and ran for the exit."

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x58FF end.13
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:5ed10b451ed0062a"
msgstr "Leaving BIAS, you find the government's~Armored Police lying in wait!~~\"Heh heh heh, out at last. Hey, kid!~Hand over what you've got there!\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x59AD end.14
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:fd01b04b65b4099e"
msgstr "\"What!? How'd you know I had this???\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5A15 end.15
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:de75d2d916c96f1a"
msgstr "\"The FRD on your shoulder, kid.~It's a transmitter. We always know~exactly where you Screamers are.\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5A9D end.16
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:ecf143ada0874e23"
msgstr "\"Here's something to take to your~grave. The Screamer system was made~so fools like you would fetch what~you're holding out of that mad BIAS.\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5B5E end.17
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:49d91a44ab9056d4"
msgstr "\"Heh heh heh... I see, I see. So that's~how it is. Got it!~Fine. Watch closely. I'll show you~something fun!\""

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5BF3 end.18
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:32bfdeebc9926f6d"
msgstr "You injected yourself with the drug!"

#: MAIN2HDE.EXE 0x5C56 end.19
#. width: 39
msgctxt "game"
msgid "sha1:a05f6b19406a20f5"
